{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4c8aF7kmvKymnAQ9Vf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place with a heavy, satisfying resonance. A deep mechanical breath exhales through ancient iron.\n\nI am closed.\n\nI am the boundary between where you are and where you wish to be. My grain holds the memory of every hand that has pressed against me — some trembling, some sure, some that never returned.\n\nMy keyhole watches you like a single dark eye.\n\nWhat do you bring to me?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}